Start, list and capture desktop sources only with a capturer WebRTC made

WebRTC makes no screen or window capturer where it cannot capture that kind of
source (on Linux: windows in a Wayland session, or anything when the X display does
not open). The media list started the capturer it did not get, on its own thread,
and the desktop capturer handed it to the cursor composer: both ended the program.

diff --git a/src/rtc_desktop_capturer_impl.cc b/src/rtc_desktop_capturer_impl.cc
index 84da594..3d01fcc 100644
--- a/src/rtc_desktop_capturer_impl.cc
+++ b/src/rtc_desktop_capturer_impl.cc
@@ -203,17 +203,24 @@ RTCDesktopCapturerImpl::RTCDesktopCapturerImpl(
 #else
